> had a potent attack and could fight my way through the hordes.

Hmmm.  I've never found hordes a real problem, if I've got
decent AC (less than -25) and a ring of conflict.  The offensive
power doesn't hurt: if you're two weaponing a +7 Grayswandir
plus a +6 or +7 Katana or long sword, you can generally kill a
MMF in a single blow, before he has time to do any real damage.
(Even more fun, with speed, you can get in two blows.  Which
with a little luck, is enough to kill Orcus before he can
teleport away, and before he's used even a single charge in his
wand.)  But having decent AC and combat is, IMHO, even more
important.  (You'll find that in some of the other roles, you
can't two weapon.  But you can still ascend, despite the weaker
offensive power.)

